#! ia 1.0

@schema workspace
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have composition
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    must have meaning.answers as text
    must have composition.systems as list of ref to system
    may have composition.sources as list of text "A root and the placement it is captured at, spelled <root> @<placement> with the placement one of authored, adopted, open, floor or runtime; for example .ia/src @authored. Admission does not check this form; an entry spelled any other way declares no root."
    may have composition.steward as ref to agent
    may have composition.public-agent as ref to agent "The intake participant that receives cross-workspace requests for this workspace."
    may have composition.private-agent as ref to agent "The internal participant that carries out work inside this workspace."
    may have composition.decides as list of text "What this workspace decides, each entry spelled <id>: <one plain sentence>; structural admission does not check this form."
